---
description: Require user-visible frontend changes to ship on web and native mobile together
alwaysApply: true
---

# Web and Mobile Parity

- Every user-visible web change must be implemented and verified in `mobile/` in the same task.
- Every user-visible mobile change must be checked against web and mirrored when the experience exists there.
- Do not call frontend work complete while one platform still differs unintentionally.
